Here is a concise report based on `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/` (there is no `Calendar.vue`, `Schedule.vue`, or `Timetable.vue` in that folder; the main schedule UI is **`SmartCalendar.vue`**).

---

## 1. Calendar / schedule (行事曆) — teacher grouping and fields

**File:** `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue`

The page has three relevant layouts:

| Mode | What groups by teacher |
|------|-------------------------|
| **排課表** (`viewMode === 'week'`) — **日** grid | One **column per teacher**; courses in a column match **`course.teacher_id`** to that column’s `teacher.id`. |
| **週檢視** (`isWeekOverview`) | Shared day columns; optional **`cb-teacher-tag`** uses **`course.teacher_id` / `course.teacher_name`**. |
| **老師清單** (`viewMode === 'teacher'`) | **`teacherGroups`** buckets by **`teacher_id` + `teacher_name`**. |

**Column list (who gets a column):** `visibleTeachers` builds from active teachers plus any `teacher_id`/`teacher_name` seen on loaded courses; then applies room filter, teacher search, student search (via which teachers have matching courses), `filterTeacherId`, and teacher-role scope.

```1697:1786:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
const visibleTeachers = computed(() => {
  const teacherList = filterTeacherOptions.value.map(t => {
    const teacherCourses = courses.value.filter(c => c.teacher_id === t.id);
    // ...
  });
  // ... roomFilter, teacherSearch, studentSearch → tidSet from filteredCourses,
  // filterTeacherId, isTeacher + currentTeacherId ...
});

const dayViewTeacherColumns = computed(() => {
  if (isWeekOverview.value) return visibleTeachers.value;
  if (weekViewTeacherIds.value.length === 0) return visibleTeachers.value;
  return visibleTeachers.value.filter(t =>
    weekViewTeacherIdSet.value.has(String(t.id))
  );
});
```

**Placing a block in a teacher column:** uses **`teacher_id`** on each merged “course” row (must equal the column’s teacher).

```1600:1608:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
const getCoursesForTeacherAt = (teacherId, hour) => {
  return filteredCourses.value.filter(c => {
    if (c.teacher_id !== teacherId) return false;
    if (parseHour(c.start_time) !== hour) return false;
    if (c.day_of_week !== selectedDow.value) return false;
    // ...
  });
};
```

**Week overview cell (same idea + optional teacher chip):**

```1643:1651:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
const getCoursesForWeekCell = (dow, hour) => {
  return filteredCourses.value.filter(c => {
    if (weekViewTeacherIds.value.length > 0 && !weekViewTeacherIdSet.value.has(String(c.teacher_id))) return false;
    // ...
  });
};
```

