```

**「老師清單」 grouping:**

```1998:2012:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
const teacherGroups = computed(() => {
  const map = {};
  filteredCourses.value.forEach(c => {
    const tid = c.teacher_id || 'unassigned';
    const tname = c.teacher_name || '未指派';
    if (!map[tid]) map[tid] = { teacher_id: tid, teacher_name: tname, courses: [], open: true };
    map[tid].courses.push(c);
  });
  // sort ...
  return Object.values(map).sort((a, b) => b.courses.length - a.courses.length);
});
```

**Data source for `teacher_id` / `teacher_name` on the grid:** `loadCourses` maps Laravel `student-classes` (and fallback Supabase) — these are **contract / student-class** fields:

```2032:2047:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue
