## 2. Course management (課程管理) — filter and list behavior

**File:** `/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue`

**UI filters** (template): student name, class type, teacher name string, course status — **no** `teacher_id` dropdown in the filter bar (only `teacher_name` search):

```30:57:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
      <div class="filter-bar grid" data-guide="course-mgmt-filters">
        <!-- 搜尋學生, 上課類型, 搜尋老師, 課程狀態 -->
```

**State and API:**

```708:708:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
const filters = ref({ name: '', class_type: '', teacher_name: '', teacher_id: '', course_status: '' });
```

```2008:2018:/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue
      const params = new URLSearchParams({
        branch_id: String(props.branchId),
