## 3. Substitute teacher (代課 / 換代課老師) — mismatch with calendar vs course detail

**Where it lives**

- **`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/SmartCalendar.vue`:** substitute UI (`substituteForm`, `openSubstituteV2`, `POST /api/v1/class-sessions/:id/substitute`), drag-to-substitute, `original_teacher_name` from `teacherDisplayName(course.teacher_id)` (contract teacher on the course object), **`loadCourses()`** after success (lines ~2812–3018, 2974–3014).
- **`/home/admin/frontend/src/pages/CourseManagement.vue`:** same API and **`updateLocalSessionRow`** to patch **that session row** with **`json.substitute_teacher_id` / `substitute_teacher_name`** immediately (lines ~2228–2283).

**Why calendar vs 「課程」行 might disagree**

1. **Grid placement and labels** use each merged row’s **`teacher_id` / `teacher_name`**. Base rows come from **`student-classes`** (contract teacher). **Scheduled exception** rows use **`ex.teacher_id`** (see `SmartCalendar.vue` ~1965–1973). So a session can appear under the **substitute’s** column only when the merged data is an exception row with that `teacher_id`; a pure **base** row still carries the **contract** `teacher_id` (see comment ~1842–1843).

2. **課程管理** list rows are **`student-classes`**; **`teacher_id` / `teacher_name` there are the course owner (正班)** unless you change the course itself. After substitute, **session-level** rows in the session list can show the **代課** teacher via `updateLocalSessionRow` patch (`CourseManagement.vue` ~2247–2259), while the **course** header/detail can still show the **original** teacher from the same record.

3. **Course detail / edit** uses **`form.teacher_id` / course `teacher_id`** from the student-class payload (e.g. edit flows around ~2521, ~2664 in `CourseManagement.vue` — not re-read here in full), which is the **contract** teacher, not the per-session substitute.

**Related file (not under `pages/` but relevant):** `LearningRecordsPage.vue` uses `isSubstituted` on events for labels like 「代課」 — different surface, same domain.

---

### Summary table

| Question | Answer |
|----------|--------|
| Schedule page file | **`SmartCalendar.vue`** (no `Calendar.vue` in `pages/`) |
| Teacher column / group key | **`teacher_id`** (and display name **`teacher_name`**) on each item in **`filteredCourses`** |
| Course mgmt list grouping | **By student**, `groupCoursesByStudent` in **`CourseManagement.vue`** |
| Course mgmt filters | **Laravel:** `name`, `class_type`, `teacher_name`, `teacher_id`, `status`; **UI** exposes name/class/teacher **name**/status; **`teacher_id`** used when **`initialTeacherId`** is set |
| Substitute mismatch | **Contract** teacher on **`student-classes`** vs **exception / session** row carrying **substitute `teacher_id`**; CM patches **session** display locally after substitute API |

